  - id: source-requirement-1
    category: evidence_closure_unverified
    label: Benefit-specific absence and exportability rules, exceptions, territorial scope and effective
      dates.
    status: candidate-evidence-only
    resolution: Review exact passages, continuations, exceptions and cross-references against this
      requirement.
  - id: applicability
    category: applicability_unresolved
    label: Resolve benefit regime, relevant date and territory; source capture is not legal applicability.
    status: not-established
    resolution: Record a bounded scope without inventing claimant facts.
  - id: legal-version
    category: legal_version_unreconciled
    label: Reconcile the applicable legal provisions, amendments and cited judgments.
    status: not-established
    resolution: Use the separately documented legal-citation reconciliation; provision links alone cannot
      close applicability.
  - id: meaning-review
    category: independent_review_pending
    label: Independent specialist review of the proposed meanings and completeness requirements.
    status: not-reviewed
    resolution: Record an attributable reviewer decision and exact reviewed version.
  - id: question-scope
    category: question_scope_unresolved
    label: Resolve the recorded question ambiguities before treating the scope as complete.
    status: not-established
    resolution: Record agreed scope for every ambiguity; no silent assumptions.
  ambiguities:
  - Which benefits and variants are in scope?
  - Temporary travel or a permanent move; destination, duration, purpose and relevant date are unspecified.
  - International coordination, residence and territorial regimes must be identified.
  scope_gaps:
  - No governed topic-specific context profile or independently complete evidence requirement in the approved
    immutable Ask index.
