    label: Conditional branch investigation only; inspecting the no-partner branch does not establish that
      the claimant has no partner. Inspecting the partner branch does not establish that
      partner status persists after care-home admission or that qualifying facts are satisfied. Separate
      permanent residence with no partner (DMG 78088 heading), one partner leaving the household, both
      partners in a home, qualifying-benefit receipt and housing-cost exclusions; self-funding
      alone is insufficient.
    status: candidate-evidence-only
    resolution: New authored paths include DMG 77117–77130, 78034–78089 and 78240–78270 plus dated
      Scottish-benefit memos. Check benefit-specific funding/payment cessation, the memo component wording,
      all cross-references and statutory applicability before closing this requirement.
